e_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Develops smoothness from the quotient of moments before differentiating, then transfers the quantitative spatial-moment inequality through local constant replacements at a fixed interior time. Compact-strip stability is a cited input; positivity is asserted only for 0<t<1, and the argument does not transfer third time derivatives or add formal acceptance."}],"target_ref":"sha256:af309f3a8460be4f12868d9deae92e9f84ec7fddc91b81a77167a172951f75ea/papers/long.json","target_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Derives the smooth-density part through a continuous quotient and simultaneous polynomial-moment bootstrap. Strict positivity is the separate density-positive passage; full support alone does not establish either conclusion."}],"to":"sha256:2b095aacecc1f5d7007325207b199a16856277bccf9cd83f2e5f52f0d81b6ef8/papers/long.md/sha256:af309f3a8460be4f12868d9deae92e9f84ec7fddc91b81a77167a172951f75ea/papers/long.json/passages/density"},{"annotation_basis":"shared_claim_ids","derived":true,"from":"sha256:0cab99e62e04475d45ef7ab47579feee2be323ae8b9c4108d1e26adbd1ba36a2/papers/short.md/sha256:70909c03af03ed97dc42b71d01507ad744339ac2af9a884a4b889c882ece1c4a/papers/short.json/passages/density-consequence","id":"shared-claims:2be34b454edfec234f9c1dc9357cb4364e0ed754f3d16123583d34fde2c2d764","kind":"shared_claim","selection_relation":"outgoing","shared_claim_refs":["sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"source_field":"passages.claim_ids","source_ref":"sha256:70909c03af03ed97dc42b71d01507ad744339ac2af9a884a4b889c882ece1c4a/papers/short.json","source_treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","claim_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0